-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHY THIS LICENCE, AND WHAT IT COVERS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains material derived from the Bank Account Fraud (BAF)
dataset suite, whose governing distribution is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. The
ShareAlike term means published derivative material must carry the same licence,
so this repository carries it.

Covered by CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 without qualification, because each of these is
derived from or embeds BAF-derived results:

  evaluation/*.json          aggregate model, strategy, fairness and linking evidence
  dashboard/data/*.json      the precomputed policy grid and figures
  docs/samples/*.xlsx        the monthly fraud KPI workbook
  docs/*.md                  documents quoting those results
  docs/screenshots/*.png     renderings of those results

The independently written source code in src/, scripts/, tests/, db/, sas/ and
infra/ is authored by this project and does not embed the dataset. As recorded in
the data and attribution record in README.md, it could be separately licensed. It is published under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 here as well, so that the whole repository carries one licence
and the NonCommercial term applies uniformly. That is a deliberate simplification
and not a claim that the code inherits ShareAlike on its own.

Raw and curated BAF data are NOT contained in this repository. They are excluded
by .gitignore and must be obtained from the source below under its own terms.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
REQUIRED ATTRIBUTION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Bank Account Fraud (BAF) dataset suite, by Sergio Jesus, Jose Pombal, Duarte
Alves, Andre F. Cruz, Pedro Saleiro, Rita P. Ribeiro, Joao Gama and Pedro
Bizarro, on behalf of Feedzai. Presented at NeurIPS 2022, Datasets and Benchmarks
track. Licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NONCOMMERCIAL
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is a non-commercial portfolio and skill-demonstration artifact. It is not
sold, not placed behind payment, and carries no advertising.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT THIS REPOSITORY IS NOT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

BAF is privacy-preserving synthetic account-opening data. Nothing here is a
production result, an observed lending outcome, or a claim about any real
portfolio, institution or person. The recorded outcome of the analysis is a
refusal to recommend the model it evaluates.
